    "body": "Local commit `6a82e57e9` is on branch `issue/3452-part-off-kerf-side` (not pushed yet).\n\n- The parting plane is now the end face of the finished part. The whole kerf of the blade is on the waste side of that face.\n- In the case of this issue (end face Z-70, 3 mm blade, orientation 2), the posted Z changes from Z-71.5 to Z-73. The kerf is Z-73..-70, and the part keeps its 70 mm length and its chamfer.\n- The refusal \"nothing to part\" now compares the kerf with the bar, not with the part. It gives the Z values.\n- At generation, a part-off move whose blade enters the finished part is refused as a gouge.\n\nThe tests were red on main and are green on the branch. The heavy lanes are next.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
